LibreYOLO LeVJEPA family
========================

This directory contains an independently implemented PyTorch inference graph
for the LeVJEPA Large video encoder. No source from LeVJEPA's CC BY-NC 4.0
``module.py`` or Hugging Face remote-code files was read, copied, adapted, or
vendored.

Architecture specification
--------------------------

LeVJEPA: Efficient & Scalable Video Pretraining without the Heuristics
Lukas Kuhn, Lucas Maes, Giuseppe Serra, Quentin Le Lidec, Yann LeCun,
Randall Balestriero, Florian Buettner, 2026.

  Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.27395
  Repository metadata and paper source:
    https://github.com/MLO-lab/LeVJEPA
    commit 941526c428aa513a5bdfa38697724fda794d8496
  Repository root license: MIT, with an explicit CC BY-NC 4.0 exception for
    module.py. The excepted file is not a source for this implementation.

The paper supplies the architectural contract used here: a 16-frame ViT with
per-frame 16x16 patch embedding, a CLS readout, factorized three-dimensional
rotary embeddings, and attention that is bidirectional within a frame and
causal across frames. The immutable checkpoint config and tensor names/shapes
were used as factual compatibility data.

