The converted checkpoint preserves the learned tensors exactly. These weights
require attribution, are for non-commercial use only, and are not covered by
LibreYOLO's MIT license. Every hosted model repository must lead its model card
with that restriction and include the CC BY-NC 4.0 license verbatim.

The released checkpoint was trained on VideoMix, described by its authors as
1.8 million clips from Kinetics-710, Something-Something v2, Walking Tours, and
PE-Video. LibreYOLO does not mirror or bundle those datasets.
